### =========================================================================
### EMOTION MODEL INFERENCE & MICROSERVICE REQUESTS (request.http)
### Analyzed from compare-models.py:
### 1. RoBERTa (base): SamLowe/roberta-base-go_emotions
### 2. ModernBERT (base): cirimus/modernbert-base-go-emotions
### =========================================================================

@hfRoBERTa = https://api-inference.huggingface.co/models/SamLowe/roberta-base-go_emotions
@hfModernBERT = https://api-inference.huggingface.co/models/cirimus/modernbert-base-go-emotions
@sentimentService = http://localhost:8003
@apiGateway = http://localhost:8000

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### SECTION 1: Direct HuggingFace Inference API Requests
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1.1 RoBERTa (base) - Single Sample Emotion Prediction
POST {{hfRoBERTa}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inputs": "I've been waiting for hours without any update. This is incredibly frustrating!"
}

### 1.2 ModernBERT (base) - Single Sample Emotion Prediction
POST {{hfModernBERT}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inputs": "I've been waiting for hours without any update. This is incredibly frustrating!"
}

