### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### SECTION 2: Local Sentiment & Emotion Microservice Endpoints (Port 8003)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2.1 Local Sentiment Service - Single Sentence Analysis with History
POST {{sentimentService}}/analyze-sentiment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isolated_sentence": "I've been waiting for hours without any update. This is incredibly frustrating!",
  "keyword_sentiment": "negative",
  "keyword_weight": 85.0,
  "history": [
    {
      "sentiment_category": "neutral",
      "keyword_sentiment": "neutral"
    }
  ]
}

### 2.2 Local Sentiment Service - Batch Analysis (Parallel Model Inference)
POST {{sentimentService}}/analyze-sentiment-batch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "isolated_sentence": "I am so grateful for all your support today.",
      "keyword_sentiment": "positive",
      "keyword_weight": 90.0
    },
    {
      "isolated_sentence": "Every time I reach out, nobody responds.",
      "keyword_sentiment": "negative",
      "keyword_weight": 80.0
    },
    {
      "isolated_sentence": "Please send me the details via email.",
      "keyword_sentiment": "neutral",
      "keyword_weight": 0.0
    }
  ]
}


### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### SECTION 3: API Gateway Integrated Pipeline (Port 8000)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3.1 API Gateway - Text Pipeline (Phrases + Emotion Classification + Redis Sliding Window)
POST {{apiGateway}}/api/v1/process-text
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Every time I reached out to customer support, I was asked to verify my information again. It's difficult to understand how a company can be so disorganized.",
  "session_id": "model_comparison_session"
}

### 3.2 API Gateway - Reset Sliding Window Session
POST {{apiGateway}}/api/v1/reset-session
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session_id": "model_comparison_session"
}
